---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="The story and the people behind Northside Accounting.">
  <section>
    <div class="page">
      <h1>About Northside Accounting</h1>
      <p>
        Northside Accounting was founded in 2009 by Robert Hale, CPA, after fifteen years at a large
        regional firm. He wanted to give small business owners the same quality of advice that big
        companies get, at a price they can afford.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today our team of six accountants serves more than 300 clients across the state. Every client
        has one dedicated accountant who knows their business.
      </p>
      <h2>Certifications</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Certified Public Accountants (CPA)</li>
        <li>QuickBooks ProAdvisor</li>
        <li>Xero Certified Advisor</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
